4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted wooden-toy aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style inspired by traditional wooden toys. Soft shapes, warm colors, and a world full of small details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.poster.avif?t=1772669363\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.webm?t=1772669363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.mp4?t=1772669363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living countryside</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers follow their routines, and the environment feels alive even when you simply stop and watch.</p>","developers":["Ond\u0159ej \u0160pan\u011bl"],"dlc":[3651530],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/3e0bd9a440bfce610a431b0739bf1f7540ac8886/header.jpg?t=1772669363","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core, Intel i3-2100 or AMD Phenom II X4 955<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any graphics card with OpenGL 3.2 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomme